---
export const prerender = true;
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const updated = 'November 2, 2026';
---

<Base
  title="Delete Your Account — Wealspring"
  description="How to delete your Wealspring account and what happens to your data."
>
  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label">Account</span>
      <h1>Delete Your Account</h1>
      <p class="page-meta">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container legal-body">
    <div class="legal-content">

      <p class="lead">Your cards and your journal belong to you. Here is exactly what happens when you delete your account.</p>

      <h2>How to delete your account</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Open <strong>Wealspring</strong> on your device.</li>
        <li>Tap the <strong>More</strong> tab (bottom right).</li>
        <li>Go to <strong>Privacy &amp; data</strong>.</li>
        <li>Tap <strong>Delete my account</strong>, enter your password and confirm.</li>
      </ol>
      <p>
        If you can’t open the app, email us at
        <a href="mailto:hello@eyeswidewellness.com" class="inline-link">hello@eyeswidewellness.com</a>
        from the address on your account and we will delete it for you.
      </p>

      <h2>What is deleted</h2>
      <p>Deletion happens straight away and can’t be undone. We remove:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Every card you’ve drawn, with your questions and notes</li>
        <li>Your personal readings and Dig Deeper conversations</li>
        <li>Your journal entries</li>
        <li>Your profile photo</li>
        <li>Your account record and sign-in details (email and password)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        After deletion, your email can no longer be used to sign in. Creating a new account starts fresh.
      </p>

      <h2>What is not deleted</h2>
      <p>
        The general meanings of each card are shared by everyone and hold nothing about you, so they stay.
      </p>

      <h2>Keep a copy first</h2>
      <p>
        In <strong>More › Privacy &amp; data</strong>, <strong>Export my journal</strong> saves every card and entry
        as a file you can keep.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about deleting your data? Reach us at
        <a href="mailto:hello@eyeswidewellness.com" class="inline-link">hello@eyeswidewellness.com</a>.
      </p>

    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
